<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 102,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 102,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog receipts Friday were 102,000 head, compared with the estimate of 95,000, USDA said. Saturday's receipts were 14,000 head, compared with the estimate of 15,000. Opening trade was not well established, with early sales Barrows and Gilts $0.50 per cwt lower than the midsession Friday.</p>
